<https://ref.openepcis.org/vocab/batterypass-ready/2.0.1> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:description "OpenEPCIS-hosted RDF reference for the data elements of the BatteryPass-Ready data model 2.0.1 (GEFEG, git.gefeg.com/bp/BatteryPassDataModel @ 64761a7), the successor of the archived Battery Pass Consortium SAMM model. Generated from the JSON Schemas by tools/vocab-sync/tools/build-bpr-vocab.py; names are GEFEG's, IRIs are minted here because the schemas publish none."@en ;
